	"Description": "Okta's own threat signals and platform health: ThreatInsight detections, requests Okta marks as suspected malicious, and rate-limit / concurrency violations (possible denial of service).\n\nNo consumers are attached. Next step after install: add a consumer flow to this alert (email, Slack, Teams, webhook, Jira, ...) to route it where your team works. Alert events are also written to the shared _alerts tag (Contents._vendor is Okta), so you can search them without a consumer. Each producer is a scheduled search; disable a producer to turn off one detection without turning off the alert.",
